    "trios-round: the canonical machine itself, implemented in queen-tick.ts, queen-dispatch.ts and queend",
    "lotus-policy: gHashTag/trinity src/tri/queen/lotus_cycle.zig, a local loop that tunes a resource policy from episodes (Observe, Evaluate, Plan, Act, and an episode record); it holds no task and leases nothing; specs/queen/lotus.t27 is its design",
    "agents-md-phases: Plan, Assign, Run, Test, Verdict, Evolve in gHashTag/trinity AGENTS.md, documented as tri queen lotus --phase and implemented nowhere; read as names for choose, start, run, review, verdict and nothing",
    "ael-v2: OBSERVE, PLAN, DELEGATE, VERIFY, SYNTHESIZE, LEARN in the CLAUDE.md files, the loop an agent session follows; a session is not a task",
