pub const WRITER_RULE : str = "the writer that starts a dispatch does not check the table: recordDispatch upserts on the issue key, archives the old row and replaces it whatever its state; the table is enforced by the choice (queend skips live claims), so a second path into the writer -- POST /queen/lease/tick, which skips the round gate -- is not covered by it";
