; --- Choosing ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
pub const CHOICE_RULE : str = "capacity, then money (only in apiMetered billing), then for each candidate in the order GitHub listed the open issues: skip a live claim, skip landed work, skip a body without a boundary, skip a boundary held by another task, and take the FIRST that survives; nothing ranks the candidates";
pub const PRIORITY_RULE : str = "there is no priority: GitHub's listing order (newest first by default) decides; QueenSalience ranks a review queue nothing calls; specs/queen/task_analysis.t27 states a priority order that no runtime applies";
pub const DEPENDENCY_RULE : str = "none: blocked-by, sub-issues, epics and depends-on text are not read when choosing";
pub const CAPACITY_RULE : str = "another bee may start while the bees in state running are fewer than TRIOS_QUEEN_MAX_WORKERS (default 4); keys x lanes bound it further at dispatch, and memory and disk guards can still refuse; when the container is full and a runner is idle, a runner-only pass asks queend again with the running bees relabelled queued and offers up to RUNNER_PASS_LIMIT (20) more tasks a round to runners only";
